        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Supporting these businesses, we have centralized certain AI-related research and development focused on advanced research in AI and developing the frontier models that serve our businesses, which is reported in Alphabet-level activities.",
        "start_character": 710,
        "end_character": 947
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001652044-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001652044-26-000018-c2f6301004f35411",
        "accession_number": "0001652044-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are subject to numerous United States (US) federal, state, and local, as well as foreign laws, and regulations covering a wide variety of subjects, and the scope of this coverage continues to broaden with continuing new legal and regulatory developments in the US and internationally.",
        "start_character": 18860,
        "end_character": 19147
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001652044-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001652044-26-000018-c2f6301004f35411",
        "accession_number": "0001652044-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "As technology continues to improve rapidly, we are focused on bringing our latest AI advances to our products and platforms.",
        "start_character": 4090,
        "end_character": 4214
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001652044-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001652044-26-000018-c2f6301004f35411",
        "accession_number": "0001652044-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "Creating products and services that people rely on every day is a journey that we are investing in for the long-term.",
        "start_character": 8968,
        "end_character": 9085
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001652044-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001652044-26-000018-c2f6301004f35411",
        "accession_number": "0001652044-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "Across Alphabet, we are also using technology to try to solve big problems that affect a wide variety of industries, including transportation and health technology.",
        "start_character": 13810,
        "end_character": 13974
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001652044-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001652044-26-000018-c2f6301004f35411",
        "accession_number": "0001652044-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We are continually enhancing these efforts over time, whether by enabling users to auto-delete their data, applying privacy technologies like on-device processing, giving people tools to control their experience, or advancing anti-malware, anti-phishing, and password security features.",
        "start_character": 6210,
        "end_character": 6496
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001652044-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001652044-26-000018-c2f6301004f35411",
        "accession_number": "0001652044-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We are focused on building an even more helpful Google for everyone, and we aspire to give everyone the tools they need to increase their knowledge, health, happiness, and success.",
        "start_character": 1494,
        "end_character": 1674
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001652044-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001652044-26-000018-c2f6301004f35411",
        "accession_number": "0001652044-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We have work councils and statutory employee representation obligations in certain countries, and we are committed to supporting protected labor rights, maintaining an open culture, and listening to our employees.",
